<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0642_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bicyclette</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0642_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rT’es un p’tit rigolo, toi!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0642_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rT’es une petite rigolote, toi!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0642_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">C’est Cycles à Gogo!\nNos ventes de Bicyclettes ont explosé!\rTout ça grâce à la pub que tu as faite.\rEn gage de remerciement, garde\nla Bicyclette!\rEncore merci!</language>
	</row>
</body>
